      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be a very useful to expose the button OnClick event so that scripts can subscribe to it directly.\n\nRight now, having to enter the function name as a string on the Button component is inconvenient, error-prone and makes it harder to track usage",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
