  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-24T13:39:17.021Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Basically right now its possible to use UI Buttons and manually make them do a specific action.\n\nHowever when it comes down to situation where you have multiple buttons that do the same thing, but to different object, it would be nice if one could just make a small script that would on start add action listener to UI Button",
